{"id":519,"flavor":[{"games":["Shield"],"text":"It’s forgetful and not very bright, but many Trainers love it anyway for its friendliness and sincerity."},{"games":["Sword"],"text":"Where people go, these Pokémon follow. If you’re scattering food for them, be careful— several hundred of them can gather at once."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Y","White"],"text":"These Pokémon live in cities. They are accustomed to people. Flocks often gather in parks and plazas."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","X","White 2","Black 2"],"text":"This very forgetful Pokémon will wait for a new order from its Trainer even though it already has one."},{"games":["Black"],"text":"Each follows its Trainer’s orders as best it can, but they sometimes fail to understand complicated commands."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Big Pecks","hidden":false,"description":"Prevents the Pokémon from having its Defense stat lowered."},{"name":"Super Luck","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon is so lucky that the critical-hit ratios of its moves are boosted."},{"name":"Rivalry","hidden":true,"description":"The Pokémon's competitive spirit makes it deal more damage to Pokémon of the same gender, but less damage to Pokémon of the opposite gender."}],"eggGroups":["Flying"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":15,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium slow","habitat":null,"color":"Gray","shape":"Wings","evolution":{"id":519,"name":"Pidove","condition":null,"children":[{"id":520,"name":"Tranquill","condition":"Lv. 21","children":[{"id":521,"name":"Unfezant","condition":"Lv. 32","children":[]}]}]},"moves":{"game":"Sword / Shield","level":[[1,16],[1,45],[4,43],[8,98],[12,269],[16,314],[20,207],[24,297],[28,197],[32,403],[36,355],[40,366],[44,143]],"machine":[97,403,213,203,263,19,116,257,182,240,156,496,214,173,211,164,241,129,269,369,253,526],"egg":[432,95,234,400,273],"tutor":[814]},"cards":[{"id":"zsv10pt5-148","name":"Pidove","set":"Black Bolt","date":"2025-07-18","rarity":"Illustration Rare","number":"148","artist":"Mori Yuu"